<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">组织者比较台</view><view class="hero"><view>一起找到</view><view>更合适的地点。</view></view><view class="sub page-intro">先看硬性限制，再比较意向、预算与往返路线。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="mini-label">SORT BY</view><view class="card-title">排序视角</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{views}}" range-key="label" value="{{viewIndex}}" bindchange="changeView"><view class="field">{{views[viewIndex].label}} ▾</view></picker><view class="hint">排序依据：{{explanation}}</view><view class="sub">所有路线均为估算。地点意向不等于最终参加承诺。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!routesConfigured}}" class="hint">腾讯位置服务尚未配置。路线显示为未计算；仍可查看预算、时间与意向。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!candidates.length}}" class="empty">暂无正在考虑的地点。</view>
  <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">推荐排序</view><view class="section-meta">{{candidates.length}} 家候选</view></view>
  <view wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="_id" class="card">
    <view class="mini-label">OPTION {{index + 1}}</view><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view>
    <view class="muted">人均 {{item.priceLabel}} · {{item.infoStatus === 'verified' ? '信息已核实' : item.infoStatus === 'pending' ? '信息待核实' : '信息未提供'}}</view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="row-wrap"><text class="status-pill orange">{{item.interested}} 人想去</text><text class="status-pill">{{item.distribution.okay}} 人接受</text></view>
    <view>意向：{{item.distribution.dislike}} 人不太想去 · {{item.distribution.cannot}} 人不方便</view>
    <view class="muted">{{item.distribution.unseen}} 人还没看过 · {{item.distribution.unrated}} 人未评价</view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.routeSummary}}">
      <view>预算：{{item.routeSummary.budgetFitCount}} 人范围内 · {{item.routeSummary.budgetConflictCount}} 人超出范围 · {{item.routeSummary.budgetUnknownCount}} 人待核实</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.routeSummary.preferenceCount}}" class="muted">{{item.routeSummary.preferenceCount}} 位成员另有一般偏好；请参考意向评价，必要时向本人确认。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.routeSummary.hardConflictCount}}" class="hint">{{item.routeSummary.hardConflictCount}} 位成员有已知硬性冲突，不能被意向抵消。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.routeSummary.hardUnknownCount}}" class="hint">{{item.routeSummary.hardUnknownCount}} 位成员的硬性条件仍需本人确认；具体限制仅本人可见。</view>
      <view>去程平均：{{item.outboundLabel}}（{{item.routeSummary.outboundKnown}} / {{item.routeSummary.totalMembers}} 已知）</view>
      <view>回程平均：{{item.returnLabel}}（{{item.routeSummary.returnKnown}} / {{item.routeSummary.totalMembers}} 已知）</view>
      <view>往返平均 / 中位：{{item.roundtripLabel}} / {{item.medianLabel}}</view>
      <view>最长个人往返：{{item.longestLabel}} · 最长回程：{{item.longestReturnLabel}}</view>
      <view>成员往返差距：{{item.gapLabel}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.routeSummary.routeUnknownCount}}" class="hint">{{item.routeSummary.routeUnknownCount}} 位成员往返路线未提供或暂时无法计算；未知不计作 0 分钟。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{!item.routeSummary.privacyThresholdMet}}" class="hint">完整往返路线少于 3 人，仅显示人数，不展示可反推个人的时长统计。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="hint">路线、预算和硬性限制摘要尚未计算，或信息变化后需要更新。</view>
    <view class="muted">路线估算更新：{{item.updatedLabel}}</view>
    <button class="button secondary" data-id="{{item._id}}" loading="{{refreshingId === item._id}}" bindtap="refresh">更新这家店的路线与可行性</button>
    <button wx:if="{{meeting.status === 'collecting'}}" class="button" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="select">考虑选定这家店</button>
  </view>
</view>
